{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012yqf8SHTe8NoA5614Lxkd2","type":"tool_result","content":"# Total Farmers Markets\n\nTo calculate the total number of farmers markets, I summed all values in the \"farmers_markets\" column across all 52 entries (50 states plus DC and Puerto Rico).\n\n**Total: 8,268 farmers markets**\n\nThis figure represents the aggregate count of farmers markets operating across all U.S. states and territories included in the dataset, with California leading at 647 and several territories having minimal markets."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc7c39b0-2558-4766-b7e5-506e4af38f7e","uuid":"f57f7cd0-5809-4d46-9361-681b56b636dd","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:47:10.966Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Total Farmers Markets\n\nTo calculate the total number of farmers markets, I summed all values in the \"farmers_markets\" column across all 52 entries (50 states plus DC and Puerto Rico).\n\n**Total: 8,268 farmers markets**\n\nThis figure represents the aggregate count of farmers markets operating across all U.S. states and territories included in the dataset, with California leading at 647 and several territories having minimal markets.","durationMs":2092,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
